<x-screen-instructions title="How to use Register Shifts">
    <p>A read-only history of every cash-drawer shift — you can browse and view here, but you can't open, close, or otherwise create a shift from this page. Those actions only happen from the check-in page's own Register section.</p>
    <p>Open a shift to see its <strong>Miscellaneous Payments</strong> tab — cash taken for something that isn't a check-in or a subscription (a vendor payment, a private rental, a donation).</p>
</x-screen-instructions>
